    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a retro style nostalgic game! It's not just a throwback to the past: it mixes the best of the past with the best of the present! Differently than old games, Supershot has new elements like shooting with the mouse cursor. It's an action-adventure game, in which you will be jumping platforms, dodging ghosts, finding hidden items, shooting ghosts and solving riddles! It has magic, shots, hearts, lives, flight and more! Easy to learn, it is great for kids! It's fun as retro games and complete as today's games! It's simple and fun, you won't have a headache playing it! 24 stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Math Perfect and Good Play</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fun and Ironic Parody of Games</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Contains the full Supershot game</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
